 "provenance": "Tibet 3 (world 2, level 2) normal exit 3,25 from spawn. Start values: weaponTier 2 (the hook; choosing Tibet on the seal grants tier >= 2 via cGame.method_75, and Tibet 1-6 start with tier 2), maxHealth 4 (default, no shop armor), lives 12 (campaign value used by the old routes); diamonds 0 (per-stage HUD). Route, controls only, no damage, no deaths: collects the 23 bottom diamonds (hooking the 8,37 stone into the pit), climbs the right shaft to checkpoint 24,18, opens the 22,19 health chest at full health (+10 diamonds), passes the patrolling enemy to checkpoint 13,16, solves the riddle room (left shooter dropped, shooters' fire crossed), opens the 23,15 health chest at full health (+10) reaching 45 diamonds, which opens the magic diamond lock at 4,25; climbs to checkpoint 12,7; cuts the row-3 grass (the column 4-5 stones drop behind), pushes the three column-9 stones off row 3 into column 10 so that the third rolls onto the 9,8 plate and holds gate 8,7 open; descends the left column (x=6) and steps right onto 6,21, which makes the 6,25 shooter fire upward (method_312): its shot breaks the 6,23 grass, the 6,22 stone falls and crushes the shooter (method_343); then walks 6,22-6,24, 5,24, 5,25, through the open lock 4,25 to the exit 3,25.",
